{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-59-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/B-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-41-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>Mr Cheung and Mrs Cheong said they have been gradually clearing stock since the redevelopment plan was announced. Seeing that the clearance work was nearing completion, they decided a few months ago to close the business on 31 July.</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/C-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-27-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/D-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-14-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-49-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/F-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-42-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>The shop floor is nearly 700 square feet, with multiple bookshelves reaching up to the ceiling. Mrs Cheong said it is now very difficult to find a space of this size to accommodate a manga store's collection. She said: \"We not only have the most popular manga titles here, we also carry some that may not be the most mainstream but are still worth reading.\"</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/G-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-04-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/H-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-30-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/I-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-50-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/J-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-54-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>Mr Cheung helped customers seal up boxes and pushed a trolley up to their delivery vehicle, saying: \"I'm worried young people aren't used to pushing these trolleys.\"</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-23-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/L-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-12-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/M-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-26-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/N-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-25-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/O-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-63-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/P-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-43-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Q-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-58-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-34-683x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/R-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-09-683x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/S-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-61-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/T-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-66-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>Full report: Choi Hung Estate Redevelopment | Comic World closes its last branch; facing life's ups and downs with a smile, clearance sale to thank customers — \"There's always a day when the music stops and the people leave.\"</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T23:39:10.035841+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":22,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}